OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,12,     Fhighlights from the Proms,
OL,13,     Fincluding music by Respighi plus
OL,14,     Fpiano music by Rachmaninoff from
OL,15,     Fthe Aldeburgh Festival and cello
OL,16,     Fmusic from Spain.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,18,     F1/5. Donald Macleod journeys
OL,19,     Fthrough the early years of Alice
OL,20,     FMary Smith, with guests Ian
OL,21,     FGraham-Jones and Leanne Langley.
